1
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:07,100
[The content, events, techniques, and outcomes of massage
depicted in this series]

2
00:00:07,210 --> 00:00:08,211
[are entirely fictional and intended for entertainment purposes only.]

3
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,421
[They should not be used as medical advice or as a reference
for traditional Thai massage.]

4
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,901
[Viewer discretion is advised. Do not attempt to imitate
any of the techniques shown,]

5
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,001
[as doing so may result in injury.]

6
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:13,161
[Massage services should only be provided by practitioners]

7
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:14,900
[who are legally licensed and registered.]

8
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:16,800
Give up on getting revenge on Dongyang.

9
00:00:16,928 --> 00:00:19,640
Once you kill someone, you'll never sleep soundly again.

10
00:00:19,728 --> 00:00:21,829
What kind of security is this? How could you let this happen?

11
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,200
That massage therapist, Hattha, snuck onto the boat.

12
00:00:23,219 --> 00:00:24,718
Why would she want to hurt Mr. Dongyang?

13
00:00:24,771 --> 00:00:27,120
She's the daughter of that massage therapist in Phuket.

14
00:00:27,192 --> 00:00:28,640
She tried to kill me.

15
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:29,831
Phuket?

16
00:00:30,206 --> 00:00:31,407
Master Tim is on his way.

17
00:00:32,515 --> 00:00:34,840
Ram them. Keep your head down. Trust me.

18
00:00:35,907 --> 00:00:37,308
Watch out! Move!

19
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,320
I told you to shoot the tires!

20
00:00:43,038 --> 00:00:46,715
She must've used the deadly massage technique.

21
00:00:46,854 --> 00:00:48,283
You went all the way there and found them.

22
00:00:48,331 --> 00:00:49,720
How could you just let them go?

23
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:52,071
Are you going to wait until she tries to kill me again?

24
00:00:52,176 --> 00:00:54,040
I have something important to discuss with them.

25
00:00:54,224 --> 00:00:56,560
Using the art of healing massage to kill people...

26
00:00:56,726 --> 00:00:58,480
the consequences will come back to haunt you.

27
00:00:58,507 --> 00:01:00,360
And you'll become the very kind of person you hate.

28
00:02:20,606 --> 00:02:21,607
Hey.

29
00:02:22,515 --> 00:02:24,760
- What's this?
- He sent it to Mr. Dongyang.

30
00:02:25,992 --> 00:02:26,993
You should find something to eat.

31
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:28,881
I can watch him.

32
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:32,100
Got it. Hey, let's go.

33
00:02:47,211 --> 00:02:48,212
This is from him.

34
00:02:49,944 --> 00:02:50,945
I'm glad you're here.

35
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:54,200
Did you find that bitch Hattha?

36
00:02:57,272 --> 00:02:58,273
Not yet.

37
00:02:58,920 --> 00:03:00,560
If you find her, don't take her to Master Tim.

38
00:03:01,646 --> 00:03:02,920
Bring her to me alive.

39
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:07,801
I'll chop off her arms and legs

40
00:03:07,843 --> 00:03:09,100
and let her die a slow death.

41
00:03:10,939 --> 00:03:11,960
Give me my phone.

42
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:15,600
I'll call Ching and have him capture that bitch right now.

43
00:03:23,848 --> 00:03:25,920
Hey, asshole! What are you doing?

44
00:04:58,464 --> 00:04:59,465
He's dead.

45
00:05:00,731 --> 00:05:02,120
Go home to your father.

46
00:05:24,100 --> 00:05:25,101
Go on.

47
00:05:27,064 --> 00:05:28,065
What?

48
00:05:28,078 --> 00:05:30,072
- Hurry up!
- What are you doing?

49
00:05:32,880 --> 00:05:33,881
Phat?

50
00:05:37,640 --> 00:05:38,641
Phat.

51
00:05:44,379 --> 00:05:46,960
Is this Mr. Wasan's room?

52
00:05:47,131 --> 00:05:49,760
No, it's Mr. Pipat's room.

53
00:05:56,678 --> 00:05:58,440
Didn't they say you were covering for them?

54
00:05:58,843 --> 00:06:01,115
Mr. Dongyang woke up and asked me to get him some coffee.

55
00:06:02,600 --> 00:06:03,601
But he's gone back to sleep now.

56
00:06:25,838 --> 00:06:26,960
Hurry up!

57
00:06:34,571 --> 00:06:35,572
Whose flowers are those?

58
00:06:36,054 --> 00:06:37,120
Phat brought them.

59
00:06:39,256 --> 00:06:40,257
Boss?

60
00:06:42,731 --> 00:06:43,732
Boss?

61
00:06:50,011 --> 00:06:51,012
Boss?

62
00:06:51,370 --> 00:06:53,000
Mr. Yang? Boss!

63
00:07:03,459 --> 00:07:05,606
Nurses' station. How can I help you?

64
00:07:05,712 --> 00:07:07,080
Help! My boss isn't breathing!

65
00:07:07,150 --> 00:07:08,151
Okay! Okay!

66
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:19,560
Are you his family? Please wait outside. This way.

67
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:22,440
- Please wait outside. This way, please.
- Boss!

68
00:07:23,752 --> 00:07:24,753
This way.

69
00:07:29,968 --> 00:07:30,969
Phat!

70
00:07:55,110 --> 00:07:57,320
Go check the security footage and call me.

71
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:09,240
And you, check the fire escape.

72
00:08:37,907 --> 00:08:39,008
Hey, wait!

73
00:08:39,230 --> 00:08:40,320
You'll scare everyone!

74
00:08:41,992 --> 00:08:42,993
Hey, stop!

75
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,160
No! Don't!

76
00:09:00,555 --> 00:09:01,556
One...

77
00:09:01,840 --> 00:09:02,841
Two...

78
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:04,201
Three...

79
00:09:04,801 --> 00:09:05,802
Four...

80
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,241
Five...

81
00:09:13,068 --> 00:09:14,069
Six...

82
00:09:14,169 --> 00:09:15,170
Fourteen...

83
00:09:15,955 --> 00:09:16,956
Fifteen...

84
00:09:21,104 --> 00:09:22,400
Hurry up!

85
00:09:22,566 --> 00:09:23,567
Hurry!

86
00:09:37,567 --> 00:09:39,600
- Hey, stop!
- Hey, stop!

87
00:09:40,787 --> 00:09:42,200
- Go! Hurry!
- Goddammit!

88
00:09:45,630 --> 00:09:48,131
You guys! Those two are heading for the hospital's front entrance!

89
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,321
Let's go!

90
00:10:07,894 --> 00:10:09,200
There's no one here, Master.

91
00:10:10,584 --> 00:10:12,040
There's no one upstairs either.

92
00:10:26,302 --> 00:10:27,303
Let's go to the hospital.

93
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,320
Phat attacked Mr. Dongyang.

94
00:10:32,478 --> 00:10:33,920
And he helped that bitch Hattha escape.

95
00:10:34,254 --> 00:10:36,963
That woman also pressed some spot on this guy and knocked him out.

96
00:10:37,827 --> 00:10:38,828
She knocked him out by pressing a spot?

97
00:10:43,307 --> 00:10:45,320
Where? Where did she press?

98
00:10:45,694 --> 00:10:47,880
- Let me see. Hold still.
- It hurts, Master!

99
00:10:47,923 --> 00:10:49,200
- Ouch! That hurts!
- Hold still!

100
00:10:54,718 --> 00:10:56,170
Mr. Dongyang has passed away.

101
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,840
I'm very sorry for your loss.

102
00:11:06,259 --> 00:11:08,000
That bastard Phat! That bitch Hattha!

103
00:11:08,771 --> 00:11:09,840
You guys, follow me!

104
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,601
No need.

105
00:11:13,662 --> 00:11:15,200
Don't waste your energy hunting them down.

106
00:11:15,576 --> 00:11:17,160
I'll make them come to me.

107
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:19,120
How are you going to do that, Master?

108
00:11:30,632 --> 00:11:31,720
Why did you kill Dongyang?

109
00:11:33,128 --> 00:11:35,803
Go back to your father, and don't ever go back there.

110
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,160
You think I'm supposed to be grateful?

111
00:11:37,736 --> 00:11:39,700
Do you know how much I've had to endure?

112
00:11:39,710 --> 00:11:42,200
How hard I've trained just so I could kill him with my own hands?

113
00:11:44,952 --> 00:11:45,953
Who hired you?

114
00:11:46,243 --> 00:11:47,244
No one.

115
00:11:47,582 --> 00:11:49,614
I told you, I don't want you to end up like me.

116
00:11:50,574 --> 00:11:51,720
Dongyang is dead.

117
00:11:51,992 --> 00:11:53,450
- It's over.
- No, it's not.

118
00:11:54,536 --> 00:11:55,537
Why did you do that?

119
00:11:56,648 --> 00:11:57,800
Who hired you?

120
00:12:00,958 --> 00:12:01,992
- Give it to me.
- No.

121
00:12:02,500 --> 00:12:04,240
- Tell me who hired you?
- No one.

122
00:12:05,411 --> 00:12:06,411
Give me back my helmet.

123
00:12:17,011 --> 00:12:18,819
Where have you been?

124
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:25,200
You still have people who love you and are worried about you.

125
00:12:26,043 --> 00:12:27,920
Don't put them through any more trouble.

126
00:12:28,230 --> 00:12:29,280
Including you, right?

127
00:12:29,830 --> 00:12:32,027
You killed Dongyang. They'll never let you get away with it.

128
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,081
Phat.

129
00:12:55,835 --> 00:12:56,836
Hey.

130
00:12:57,286 --> 00:12:58,287
Come on, let's go home.

131
00:13:27,515 --> 00:13:28,600
I killed Dongyang.

132
00:13:29,024 --> 00:13:30,125
He's dead, Dad.

133
00:13:34,059 --> 00:13:35,320
What the hell have you done?

134
00:13:36,230 --> 00:13:37,360
I told you to keep an eye on him,

135
00:13:37,936 --> 00:13:39,100
not kill him!

136
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,320
Was it this guy, one of Dongyang's men,

137
00:14:23,312 --> 00:14:25,240
who texted you that night

138
00:14:25,891 --> 00:14:27,400
to warn you that Master Tim was coming to our house?

139
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:32,120
And he even killed Dongyang for you.

140
00:14:33,928 --> 00:14:35,100
I think he likes you.

141
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,120
Do you like him too?

142
00:14:40,091 --> 00:14:42,840
You were with him last night when you disappeared, weren't you?

143
00:14:43,270 --> 00:14:45,040
No! It's not what you all think!

144
00:14:45,060 --> 00:14:46,100
Nothing happened between us.

145
00:14:47,238 --> 00:14:48,640
I haven't even thought about him that way.

146
00:14:48,939 --> 00:14:50,280
You're the one thinking about it!

147
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,560
- But he's pretty handsome.
- Minkheng.

148
00:14:54,256 --> 00:14:55,560
- And he's good at what he does, too.
- Minkheng!

149
00:14:56,115 --> 00:14:57,960
He even broke in and killed Dongyang.

150
00:14:58,099 --> 00:14:59,100
Will you stop already?

151
00:15:00,568 --> 00:15:01,742
But I agree with him.

152
00:15:02,462 --> 00:15:03,600
You shouldn't go back there.

153
00:15:04,526 --> 00:15:05,570
There's still that flatfooted bastard.

154
00:15:05,600 --> 00:15:07,201
You're still going on about that flatfooted guy?

155
00:15:08,603 --> 00:15:09,744
Dongyang's death

156
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,440
is a big deal, you know.

157
00:15:11,952 --> 00:15:14,438
His men are probably already looking for whoever killed him.

158
00:15:15,136 --> 00:15:17,080
Not to mention his business partners.

159
00:15:17,550 --> 00:15:20,158
Don't worry, Dad. I'm following Arokaya Land's page.

160
00:15:20,731 --> 00:15:21,891
If anything happens, they'll post an update.

161
00:15:22,931 --> 00:15:26,640
Thank you to everyone who's sent me messages out of concern.

162
00:15:27,195 --> 00:15:28,840
I'm Dongyang, and I'm alive and well.

163
00:15:31,792 --> 00:15:34,120
As they say, good people like me

164
00:15:34,395 --> 00:15:36,840
always come out of trouble unscathed.

165
00:15:39,710 --> 00:15:40,840
Dongyang's still alive!

166
00:15:41,384 --> 00:15:42,640
What's going on, kiddo?

167
00:15:42,691 --> 00:15:44,180
I saw him die with my own eyes!

168
00:15:52,300 --> 00:15:54,301
[Hattha]

169
00:15:59,963 --> 00:16:01,920
Hello? Did you see Dongyang's livestream?

170
00:16:03,099 --> 00:16:04,160
How is that even possible?

171
00:16:04,320 --> 00:16:06,121
I saw you kill him myself.

172
00:16:06,747 --> 00:16:07,748
I'll go check it out.

173
00:16:08,120 --> 00:16:09,240
You be careful, okay?

174
00:16:10,096 --> 00:16:12,397
If he's really alive, he'll be furious with both of us.

175
00:16:12,848 --> 00:16:13,849
I have to go.

176
00:16:13,936 --> 00:16:14,937
Wait.

177
00:16:15,552 --> 00:16:16,640
Something doesn't seem right.

178
00:16:17,488 --> 00:16:19,120
Dongyang was still in the hospital this morning.

179
00:16:19,159 --> 00:16:21,160
So how is he livestreaming from Arokaya Land now?

180
00:16:21,544 --> 00:16:23,600
He doesn't even look injured. He looks way too normal.

181
00:16:26,323 --> 00:16:27,324
Be careful.

182
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:48,561
Minkheng.

183
00:16:48,620 --> 00:16:50,360
Give Dad his medicine. I'll take care of this.

184
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:51,401
Okay.

185
00:16:56,342 --> 00:16:58,240
If you're going to ask me to convince Uncle to let you go back,

186
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:00,001
don't bother.

187
00:17:00,939 --> 00:17:03,115
I just want to make sure he's really dead.

188
00:17:03,579 --> 00:17:04,880
Then I'll come straight back. I promise.

189
00:17:05,334 --> 00:17:06,335
Go talk to your dad yourself.

190
00:17:07,083 --> 00:17:08,084
Wan.

191
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:12,979
You keep thinking about avenging someone who's already dead.

192
00:17:14,051 --> 00:17:15,326
Don't you ever think about the people who are still alive?

193
00:17:18,200 --> 00:17:19,720
Do you know how worried your dad was

194
00:17:20,240 --> 00:17:21,547
when you disappeared last night?

195
00:17:22,011 --> 00:17:23,387
He couldn't eat or sleep at all.

196
00:17:24,347 --> 00:17:25,348
What about me?

197
00:17:26,662 --> 00:17:27,880
I can't sleep either.

198
00:17:29,400 --> 00:17:32,118
Every time I close my eyes, I still see Mom and P'Phak being killed by those people.

199
00:17:34,401 --> 00:17:36,363
Just because we're ordinary people

200
00:17:37,100 --> 00:17:38,395
doesn't mean we have to give in to them, does it?

201
00:17:40,302 --> 00:17:41,603
But you're all alone.

202
00:17:41,670 --> 00:17:43,840
- So what?
- What can you possibly do on your own?

203
00:17:44,334 --> 00:17:46,000
Are you going to take revenge on everyone who's hurt us?

204
00:17:46,691 --> 00:17:49,480
Even if you get rid of one, there'll always be another bad guy.

205
00:17:51,779 --> 00:17:53,550
Are you going to keep Uncle waiting and worrying,

206
00:17:53,678 --> 00:17:55,912
without even noticing how much older he's getting?

207
00:17:57,230 --> 00:17:58,231
Do you realize

208
00:17:58,755 --> 00:18:00,960
he might only have months, years, or days left with you?

209
00:18:07,504 --> 00:18:08,880
Is there something wrong with Dad that I don't know about?

210
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:14,907
No. Korn is still healthy.

211
00:18:17,131 --> 00:18:19,014
But if you keep seeking revenge,

212
00:18:20,059 --> 00:18:23,060
one day, Uncle will get dragged into this too.

213
00:18:24,486 --> 00:18:26,500
I don't want you to end up regretting it.

214
00:19:08,683 --> 00:19:10,470
Maintenance! Come take a look over here!

215
00:19:12,900 --> 00:19:13,901
Maintenance!

216
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:16,881
Maintenance!

217
00:19:17,248 --> 00:19:18,249
Phat!

218
00:19:30,526 --> 00:19:32,800
The VIP guests are getting really angry. Is the food ready yet?

219
00:19:32,939 --> 00:19:34,160
The food's on its way.

220
00:20:03,094 --> 00:20:04,790
- Which floor?
- The VIP floor.

221
00:20:20,563 --> 00:20:21,564
Sorry.

222
00:20:52,542 --> 00:20:53,543
Put it over there.

223
00:20:58,220 --> 00:20:59,520
Phat hasn't shown up yet, Master.

224
00:21:00,462 --> 00:21:01,463
He'll come.

225
00:21:02,494 --> 00:21:03,640
He has no choice but to come.

226
00:21:08,339 --> 00:21:10,280
Desmond wants to video call the VIP.

227
00:21:12,584 --> 00:21:13,585
Sure.

228
00:21:14,371 --> 00:21:15,372
Go ahead.

229
00:21:15,704 --> 00:21:16,705
Yes, sir.

230
00:21:51,822 --> 00:21:53,680
Hi. What's up Desmond?

231
00:21:54,195 --> 00:21:57,760
I heard you're sick. Is everything okay, Dongyang?

232
00:21:58,605 --> 00:21:59,920
Yeah, I'm alright.

233
00:22:00,704 --> 00:22:04,440
Come on, man. Don't forget who I am.

234
00:22:05,560 --> 00:22:06,561
Don't worry.

235
00:22:06,854 --> 00:22:08,800
Everything is still the same.

236
00:22:09,275 --> 00:22:10,496
I'm glad to hear that.

237
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:13,440
If you weren't here, I didn't trust anyone else.

238
00:22:41,647 --> 00:22:42,840
What's wrong with Master Tim's feet, Dad?

239
00:22:43,307 --> 00:22:44,408
You're still on about that?

240
00:22:44,900 --> 00:22:46,401
Stay away from Master Tim.

241
00:22:49,595 --> 00:22:50,800
I was just asking.

242
00:22:52,795 --> 00:22:53,880
I'm serious.

243
00:22:55,403 --> 00:22:57,404
Master Tim is not someone you should mess with.

244
00:22:58,827 --> 00:22:59,963
Stay away from him.

245
00:23:35,726 --> 00:23:37,680
I'm going to Bangkok to make a delivery.

246
00:23:38,102 --> 00:23:39,760
I'll stop by the house to pick up some things, too.

247
00:23:40,070 --> 00:23:41,560
- Do you need anything?
- I'm coming with you.

248
00:23:44,934 --> 00:23:46,300
It's dangerous for Wan to go alone.

249
00:23:48,507 --> 00:23:49,520
Really, Dad.

250
00:23:50,310 --> 00:23:51,311
Are you sure?

251
00:23:57,500 --> 00:23:58,560
Then hurry back.

252
00:24:01,971 --> 00:24:03,300
Take care of her, okay?

253
00:24:03,987 --> 00:24:04,988
Yes, Dad.

254
00:24:16,216 --> 00:24:17,960
You can go get it, Wan. I'll keep watch.

255
00:24:18,302 --> 00:24:19,925
Keep watch for what? No need.

256
00:24:20,110 --> 00:24:21,111
We're going together.

257
00:25:04,288 --> 00:25:05,880
They've returned to the house in Talat Phlu.

258
00:25:26,870 --> 00:25:27,871
I'll take care of it myself.

259
00:25:39,771 --> 00:25:41,600
- Muk?-
- Master Tim wants to talk to you two.

260
00:25:42,070 --> 00:25:44,352
What's it about? I have somewhere I need to be.

261
00:25:45,112 --> 00:25:46,504
Master Tim wants to see both of you.

262
00:25:47,406 --> 00:25:48,520
Especially Hattha.

263
00:25:51,198 --> 00:25:52,199
Come on.

264
00:25:54,056 --> 00:25:56,080
Please come with us nicely. Don't make us force you.

265
00:25:56,080 --> 00:25:59,446
You know what Master Tim wants to talk to my sister about, don't you?

266
00:26:02,100 --> 00:26:03,301
Those bruises on your neck...

267
00:26:04,571 --> 00:26:05,600
Master Tim did that to you, didn't he?

268
00:26:09,824 --> 00:26:11,360
Why would he hurt you like that?

269
00:26:13,100 --> 00:26:14,160
Are you hurt anywhere else?

270
00:26:15,854 --> 00:26:17,680
- Let's hurry up and go.
- Muk!

271
00:26:19,608 --> 00:26:21,043
I told you to stay in the car.

272
00:26:22,609 --> 00:26:23,610
Watch out!

273
00:26:28,050 --> 00:26:29,520
Get in the car!

274
00:26:31,051 --> 00:26:32,052
Hey.

275
00:26:32,640 --> 00:26:34,520
If you don't run now, I won't be able to help you anymore.

276
00:26:36,286 --> 00:26:37,287
Phat, you bastard!

277
00:26:37,875 --> 00:26:39,080
Hey! Open up!

278
00:26:42,483 --> 00:26:43,484
Thank you.

279
00:26:58,752 --> 00:27:00,960
I'm glad to be doing business with you, Master Tim.

280
00:27:01,659 --> 00:27:03,768
You're much easier to deal with than Dongyang.

281
00:27:04,856 --> 00:27:05,857
What are you going to do with Phat?

282
00:27:07,219 --> 00:27:09,880
My men who know what happened are really upset.

283
00:27:12,270 --> 00:27:15,200
I'll take care of him myself, don't worry.

284
00:27:15,315 --> 00:27:16,800
Well, I'd better get going.

285
00:27:24,120 --> 00:27:25,121
[Muk]

286
00:27:25,928 --> 00:27:27,760
Have you got them?

287
00:27:46,646 --> 00:27:47,647
What?

288
00:27:48,182 --> 00:27:49,760
I knew something was off during the livestream.

289
00:27:51,000 --> 00:27:52,640
Master Tim used a Deepfake to fool everyone.

290
00:27:55,667 --> 00:27:56,668
So that means...

291
00:27:57,886 --> 00:27:59,160
Dongyang really is dead?

292
00:27:59,448 --> 00:28:00,449
Yeah.

293
00:28:01,272 --> 00:28:03,320
And they probably know I killed him.

294
00:28:05,552 --> 00:28:06,553
But don't worry.

295
00:28:07,760 --> 00:28:09,100
Dongyang's men don't know about this place.

296
00:28:13,387 --> 00:28:14,960
Then why are you getting a gun ready?

297
00:28:17,694 --> 00:28:18,695
Just in case.

298
00:28:29,016 --> 00:28:30,017
[Dad]

299
00:28:32,830 --> 00:28:33,831
Hello?

300
00:28:34,904 --> 00:28:36,840
Dad, calm down. Calm down.

301
00:28:38,315 --> 00:28:39,520
Listen to me first, Dad.

302
00:28:40,235 --> 00:28:42,040
No, I'm okay now. I'm safe.

303
00:28:43,526 --> 00:28:44,800
Dad, listen.

304
00:28:46,100 --> 00:28:47,250
Please listen to me first.

305
00:28:47,800 --> 00:28:50,040
I haven't done anything. Really, I haven't done anything!

306
00:28:50,050 --> 00:28:51,920
And I'm safe now. I'm okay.

307
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:53,001
Okay.

308
00:29:06,744 --> 00:29:09,920
If you find Hattha and her family, kill them all.

309
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:36,301
[Areeya]

310
00:29:51,507 --> 00:29:53,859
- Can you help me?
- I've got Master Tim's address. Write it down.

311
00:29:53,910 --> 00:29:55,700
Okay, okay. Hold on a second.

312
00:30:36,700 --> 00:30:38,160
What's wrong with Master Tim's feet, Dad?

313
00:30:38,592 --> 00:30:39,640
You're still on about that?

314
00:30:40,064 --> 00:30:42,065
Master Tim is not someone you should mess with.

315
00:30:43,483 --> 00:30:44,614
Stay away from him.

316
00:31:27,107 --> 00:31:28,108
Hey.

317
00:31:45,598 --> 00:31:46,599
Hattha.

318
00:31:47,500 --> 00:31:48,501
Hattha!

319
00:32:12,800 --> 00:32:14,701
[Master Tim's House, 95 Ratchadaphisek Road, Soi 95]

320
00:32:26,275 --> 00:32:27,560
- Master.
- Go inside.

321
00:32:30,276 --> 00:32:31,440
- Master, please.
- Just get in.

322
00:33:36,755 --> 00:33:37,756
Get inside.

323
00:33:56,814 --> 00:33:58,000
You screwed up, you know that?

324
00:33:58,478 --> 00:34:00,800
You went through all that trouble to find them, and then you let them get away!

325
00:34:01,224 --> 00:34:03,443
I won't do it again.

326
00:34:03,752 --> 00:34:04,753
Get up here.

327
00:34:07,208 --> 00:34:08,209
Get up here!

328
00:34:11,560 --> 00:34:12,561
Where do you think you're going?

329
00:34:27,043 --> 00:34:28,720
That hurts, Master!

330
00:34:31,816 --> 00:34:32,840
You're going to hurt a lot more than that.

331
00:34:44,563 --> 00:34:46,160
A lot more!

332
00:35:49,040 --> 00:35:50,280
Master Tim doesn't have flat feet.

333
00:36:41,715 --> 00:36:42,716
Give me the bag.

334
00:36:46,550 --> 00:36:47,551
Want some water?

335
00:36:54,368 --> 00:36:56,369
Hattha, what's wrong?

336
00:36:56,900 --> 00:36:59,040
Hattha, take it easy.

337
00:37:04,126 --> 00:37:05,127
Feeling better?

338
00:37:08,523 --> 00:37:09,640
Calm down. Calm down.

339
00:37:25,443 --> 00:37:27,520
Is this why Dad didn't want us getting involved with Master Tim?

340
00:37:30,323 --> 00:37:32,040
Because he's really scary.

341
00:37:35,955 --> 00:37:37,600
Then why did you go to Master Tim's house?

342
00:37:43,766 --> 00:37:45,400
I wanted to know if he had flat feet.

343
00:37:48,715 --> 00:37:50,203
He's the one who killed my mom that day,

344
00:37:52,880 --> 00:37:53,881
that flatfooted bastard!

345
00:37:59,000 --> 00:38:00,120
You're the flatfooted bastard!

346
00:38:01,216 --> 00:38:03,120
Mom! Mom!

347
00:38:15,363 --> 00:38:16,480
This is serious, you know.

348
00:38:20,446 --> 00:38:21,447
Hang in there, okay?

349
00:38:41,032 --> 00:38:42,595
This is grown-up business. Go to bed.

350
00:39:08,381 --> 00:39:09,382
Follow me.

351
00:39:36,300 --> 00:39:38,523
When I was a kid, I lived with my mom in Bangkok.

352
00:39:41,574 --> 00:39:44,448
One day, she took me to Phuket to surprise my dad.

353
00:39:46,400 --> 00:39:48,320
But that was the day I found out

354
00:39:49,088 --> 00:39:51,115
my dad had another family there.

355
00:39:54,923 --> 00:39:56,700
He had another son with his wife.

356
00:40:07,125 --> 00:40:10,920
After that, I went to the beach and cried.

357
00:40:15,360 --> 00:40:17,280
Then, out of nowhere, a little girl

358
00:40:18,997 --> 00:40:20,040
came up to me.

359
00:40:22,896 --> 00:40:23,897
Phuket?

360
00:40:36,707 --> 00:40:39,640
Hey, have you seen my money? It blew this way.

361
00:40:41,416 --> 00:40:43,064
Have you seen my money?

362
00:40:43,110 --> 00:40:44,111
No.

363
00:40:44,846 --> 00:40:47,720
Are you crying? What's wrong? Are you sick?

364
00:40:47,926 --> 00:40:50,000
I have a headache. Leave me alone.

365
00:40:58,499 --> 00:40:59,520
Feeling better?

366
00:41:02,344 --> 00:41:04,040
This is my dad's shop. You can go there.

367
00:41:24,963 --> 00:41:26,140
How long have you known?

368
00:41:28,000 --> 00:41:30,667
Since I saw you and your dad giving massages to elderly people at the temple.

369
00:41:32,624 --> 00:41:35,120
He told me your dad used to run a massage shop in Phuket.

370
00:41:39,765 --> 00:41:42,800
I can't believe that little girl grew up to be you.

371
00:41:44,805 --> 00:41:46,960
And that little boy grew up to be a hitman?

372
00:41:53,136 --> 00:41:55,050
We both have painful pasts.

373
00:41:55,803 --> 00:41:57,720
It's too late for me to turn my life around.

374
00:41:59,670 --> 00:42:01,250
But you can still stop now.

375
00:42:02,950 --> 00:42:06,520
Give up on revenge. Stop looking for that flatfooted bastard.

376
00:42:07,584 --> 00:42:09,560
And go back to living your life with your dad.

377
00:42:19,827 --> 00:42:22,360
I don't want the hands that gave me a massage that day

378
00:42:23,859 --> 00:42:24,960
to end up covered in blood

379
00:42:27,240 --> 00:42:28,241
like mine.

380
00:42:36,542 --> 00:42:37,880
You did all this

381
00:42:39,838 --> 00:42:41,640
just because I was that little girl?

382
00:42:47,358 --> 00:42:48,840
After I met you that day,

383
00:42:52,024 --> 00:42:53,025
the next day,

384
00:42:54,531 --> 00:42:56,160
my mom died in a car accident.

385
00:43:00,643 --> 00:43:02,766
My dad sent me to live with my uncle, who was a hitman.

386
00:43:06,184 --> 00:43:07,848
My life changed forever that day.

387
00:43:12,246 --> 00:43:14,651
You were the last bit of happiness in my life.

388
00:44:32,758 --> 00:44:33,759
Let's go.

389
00:44:34,758 --> 00:44:35,920
- Phat?
- Let's go.

390
00:44:36,576 --> 00:44:37,577
- Just go.
- Phat?

391
00:44:40,341 --> 00:44:41,720
- Hey, kiddo.
- Wan?

392
00:44:43,814 --> 00:44:45,755
Thank you for letting me know.

393
00:44:49,440 --> 00:44:50,841
Go home with your brother.

394
00:44:52,363 --> 00:44:54,040
Live a happy life with your father.

395
00:44:55,200 --> 00:44:56,201
For me, too.

396
00:44:58,390 --> 00:44:59,391
Come on, let's go.

397
00:44:59,664 --> 00:45:01,040
- Phat?
- Let's go.

398
00:45:05,099 --> 00:45:06,100
Phat?

399
00:45:49,843 --> 00:45:50,960
He did the right thing.

400
00:45:52,190 --> 00:45:53,500
I think he cares about you.

401
00:46:18,400 --> 00:46:19,401
Wan!

402
00:46:24,571 --> 00:46:25,880
- What is it?
- That is Mr. Krit.

403
00:46:30,470 --> 00:46:31,920
I know who can help us.

404
00:46:35,902 --> 00:46:37,300
Hey! Wait.

405
00:46:40,531 --> 00:46:42,400
Hello, I…

406
00:46:42,430 --> 00:46:44,720
Do you

407
00:46:45,000 --> 00:46:46,120
I have no idea.

408
00:46:46,800 --> 00:46:47,801
I'm sorry.

409
00:47:27,872 --> 00:47:28,873
I've got a keycard, sir.

410
00:47:57,766 --> 00:47:59,250
Sir? This way.

411
00:48:08,422 --> 00:48:09,686
Go catch him downstairs! Go!

412
00:48:09,787 --> 00:48:10,788
Got it, sir.

413
00:48:23,419 --> 00:48:24,420
Hey!

414
00:48:30,952 --> 00:48:31,953
No.

415
00:48:32,878 --> 00:48:34,715
Please, please.

416
00:48:35,475 --> 00:48:37,776
Please help me. I need to see where Mr. Krit was heading to.

417
00:48:37,800 --> 00:48:39,560
I have something important to talk to him.

418
00:48:39,870 --> 00:48:41,080
You're asking me to break the rules.

419
00:48:41,454 --> 00:48:42,760
Nobody will find out about it.

420
00:48:43,539 --> 00:48:46,250
Do you like massages? I'm really good at them. I'll give you one for free!

421
00:49:03,262 --> 00:49:04,263
Hey!

422
00:49:06,063 --> 00:49:07,664
Are you going to shoot me?

423
00:49:09,251 --> 00:49:10,344
Do you want to shoot me?

424
00:49:47,046 --> 00:49:48,047
11…

425
00:49:48,384 --> 00:49:49,385
12…

426
00:49:49,800 --> 00:49:50,801
13…

427
00:49:51,320 --> 00:49:52,321
14…

428
00:49:52,800 --> 00:49:53,801
15…

429
00:50:17,496 --> 00:50:19,320
Let me go, damn it!

430
00:50:28,480 --> 00:50:30,280
Flatfoot insoles?

431
00:50:32,064 --> 00:50:33,400
Lord Krit uses these too?

432
00:50:59,568 --> 00:51:00,760
Mr. Krit has flat feet?

433
00:51:17,337 --> 00:51:19,338
Why did Mr. Krit hurt you?

434
00:51:20,080 --> 00:51:22,800
I want to know if Mr. Krit is the flatfooted bastard who killed my mother.

435
00:51:23,400 --> 00:51:24,920
Stop looking for that flatfooted bastard.

436
00:51:26,320 --> 00:51:28,500
Anyway, what brings you all the way to my house today?

437
00:51:29,080 --> 00:51:30,760
Is there something you need?

438
00:51:31,120 --> 00:51:32,440
Let's talk in my office.
